t Infrastructure BIM</b><span>UAE</span><span class=\"l\">LOD 400</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/case-studies/masterplan-site-infrastructure-bim/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Masterplan Site Infrastructure BIM</b><span>UAE</span><span class=\"l\">LOD 300</span></a></li></ul>\n</div></section>\n\n\n<section class=\"coal pad\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Delivery workflow</p><h2 class=\"h2\">How Infrastructure BIM <em>runs.</em></h2></div><p class=\"lead\">Five stages, with QA/QC before anything is issued.</p></div>\n  <div class=\"flow f5\"><div class=\"rv\"><b>01</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Scope &amp; BEP</h3><p>Confirm deliverables, LOD/LOI matrix and standards.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>02</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Survey import</h3><p>Topographic survey and existing utilities imported to the project coordinate system.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>03</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Corridor/network modelling</h3><p>Alignments, profiles, corridors and pipe networks modelled and graded.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>04</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">QA/QC</h3><p>Run model health, standards and clash checks before issue.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>05</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Coordination</h3><p>Utility crossings and interfaces checked against roads and structures.</p></div></div></div>\n</div></section>\n\n\n<section class=\"pad\"><div class=\"wrap pn\">\n  <a href=\"/bim-services/mep-bim/\"><img width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-mep.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"Engineer inspecting red fire protection pipework in a plant room\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width:900px) 100vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-mep.jpg 1920w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-mep-300x200.jpg 300w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-mep-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-mep-768x512.jpg 768w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/